The '''Asikyira national football team''' represents [[Asikyira]] in men's international association football. It is governed by the [[Asikyiran Football Association]] and is the top-ranked team in the [[AFA Men's World Ranking]] as of June 2026. Asikyira qualified for the [[2026 AFA World Cup]], where it appears in [[2026 AFA World Cup#Group H|Group H]] with [[United Midlands national football team|United Midlands]] and [[Yanbaru national football team|Yanbaru]].

This article keeps to a basic current roster while the city and club pages for Asikyira are still being developed.

